.SS "template<\fBunsigned\fP \fBint\fP W = 1>
.br
class SyscTComb< W >"The SyscTComb::sc_core::sc_module template class\&. 

A generic SystemC template module that implements a combinational block with N inputs of Win bits each (called d0, d1, etc\&.) and a single Wout-bits output called y\&. The modeled circuit is combinational, \fBi\&.e\fP\&., the output is updated whenever any of the inputs changes\&. 
